<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Source English strings (en-US is the canonical source). Common actions, buttons and generic
  errors. Split across the five strings*.xml files so large extraction PRs stay reviewable and
  Weblate's component-discovery addon (Phase 4b) can pair each with its own base file.

  Authoring rules (see docs/i18n.md):
    - Always positional placeholders (%1$s), never bare %s.
    - One string per sentence; never concatenate fragments.
    - <plurals> for anything counted; `other` is mandatory in every <plurals>.
    - translatable="false" keys live in donottranslate.xml, not here.
    - Never persist a resolved translation or a resource id.
    - A string used for comparison/parsing/protocol is a KEY, not a display label: never translate it.

  Phase 0 ships this file empty of translatable keys; Phase 1 extracts the ~1,600 literals into
  this and the four sibling files below.
-->
